      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Luego crearon al primer hombre y a la primera mujer: Oxomoco y Cipactónal.",
          "en": "Next they made the first man and the first woman: Oxomoco and Cipactonal."
        },
        {
          "es": "A él le mandaron trabajar la tierra. A ella, hilar y tejer.",
          "en": "They told him to work the land. They told her to spin thread and weave cloth."
        },
        {
          "es": "A ella también le dieron granos de maíz, para curar a los enfermos y para adivinar el futuro.",
          "en": "They also gave her grains of maize, to heal the sick and to read the future."
        },
        {
          "es": "De esta pareja nacería la gente común. Los mexicas la llamaban macehualtin.",
          "en": "From this couple, the common people would be born. The Mexica called them macehualtin."
        }
      ],
